---
description: GenomeScope project rules
alwaysApply: true
---
- Never invent genomic facts, coordinates, rsIDs, citations or API fields; verify against source docs or real API responses.
- Every generated claim must reference evidence IDs with source URLs.
- Keep LLM calls behind agents/base.py; verification must use a separate call from analysis.
- All external calls are async, cached, rate-limited and retried.
- Add or update tests with every change; run them before finishing a task.
- Show the research-prototype disclaimer in UI, reports and exports.
- No clinical advice, diagnosis or treatment suggestions, ever.
- Secrets only via environment variables.
